WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.199
[Gentle music]
SharpLsp completes F# with the F# compiler itself. Type List dot for every list function, narrow it to minBy, and inside the lambda, the record's fields are right there.

00:22.017 --> 00:32.605
In C#, completion comes straight from Roslyn: LINQ's MinBy, then the product's properties. Accepting an item replaces the word you're typing, never appends to it.

00:44.983 --> 00:54.218
Need a type from a namespace you haven't imported? Press Control Space, accept it, and SharpLsp adds the using directive at the top of the file.
